 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# SpaceX Falcon 9 EDA with SQL\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook uses SQL queries to explore the SpaceX Falcon 9 launch dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "The analysis focuses on launch sites, mission outcomes, payloads, and launch performance."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Import Libraries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import sqlite3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Load the SpaceX Dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import requests\n",
    "\n",
    "response = requests.get(\"https://api.spacexdata.com/v4/launches/past\")\n",
    "response.raise_for_status()\n",
    "\n",
    "launches = response.json()\n",
    "df = pd.json_normalize(launches)\n",
    "\n",
    "rocket_response = requests.get(\"https://api.spacexdata.com/v4/rockets\")\n",
    "rocket_response.raise_for_status()\n",
    "rockets = rocket_response.json()\n",
    "\n",
    "rocket_lookup = {rocket[\"id\"]: rocket[\"name\"] for rocket in rockets}\n    df[\"rocket_name\"] = df[\"rocket\"].map(rocket_lookup)\n    df = df[df[\"rocket_name\"].str.contains(\"Falcon 9\", na=False)].copy()\n    \n    print(\"Falcon 9 records:\", len(df))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Prepare a SQL Analysis Table"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sql_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    \"FlightNumber\": range(1, len(df) + 1),\n",
    "    \"Launch_Date\": pd.to_datetime(df[\"date_utc\"], errors=\"coerce\"),\n",
    "    \"Launch_Site\": df[\"launchpad\"],\n",
    "    \"Mission_Outcome\": df[\"success\"].map({True: \"Success\", False: \"Failure\"}),\n    "    \"Orbit\": df[\"orbit\"] if \"orbit\" in df.columns else None,\n    "    \"Rocket\": df[\"rocket_name\"]\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "sql_df[\"Year\"] = sql_df[\"Launch_Date\"].dt.year\n",
    "\n",
    "sql_df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Create SQLite Database"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "conn = sqlite3.connect(\":memory:\")\n",
    "\n",
    "sql_df.to_sql(\"SPACEXTBL\", conn, index=False, if_exists=\"replace\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"SQL table SPACEXTBL created successfully.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. View the First 20 Records"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"SELECT * FROM SPACEXTBL LIMIT 20\"\n",
    "pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Number of Launches by Launch Site"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "SELECT Launch_Site, COUNT(*) AS Launch_Count\n",
    "FROM SPACEXTBL\n",
    "GROUP BY Launch_Site\n",
    "ORDER BY Launch_Count DESC\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Mission Outcomes by Launch Site"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "SELECT Launch_Site, Mission_Outcome, COUNT(*) AS Count\n",
    "FROM SPACEXTBL\n",
    "GROUP BY Launch_Site, Mission_Outcome\n",
    "ORDER BY Launch_Site, Count DESC\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Launches by Year"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "SELECT Year, COUNT(*) AS Launch_Count\n",
    "FROM SPACEXTBL\n",
    "GROUP BY Year\n",
    "ORDER BY Year\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. Mission Success Rate"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "SELECT\n",
    "    SUM(CASE WHEN Mission_Outcome = 'Success' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 100.0 / COUNT(*) AS Success_Rate\n",
    "FROM SPACEXTBL\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. Launches by Orbit"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "SELECT Orbit, COUNT(*) AS Launch_Count\n",
    "FROM SPACEXTBL\n",
    "WHERE Orbit IS NOT NULL\n",
    "GROUP BY Orbit\n",
    "ORDER BY Launch_Count DESC\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.read_sql_query(query, conn)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "SQL was used to analyze SpaceX Falcon 9 launch activity, mission outcomes, launch sites, yearly trends, success rates, and orbit distributions."
   ]
  }
